/P 62 0 R
/E (Under the current system, people in state custody have been abused, tortured, sent to hospitals with life-threatening injuries, and even brutally murdered. Steven Davis, whose story is central to The Alabama Solution, was taken to the University of Alabama at Birmingham \(UAB\) in critical condition, then pronounced dead, after being repeatedly beaten by correctional officer Lt. Roderick Gadson. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3 179 0 R 5]
